  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mo>∵</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Where, <math><mi>μ</mi></math> refractive index of medium<br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />But, <math><mi>μ</mi><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>∵</mo><msub><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><br />Thus, <math><msub><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></math> is greater to all of them<br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math> Apparent depth is minimum for violet.<br /><br />It means that the violet letter appear raised more.",
